/tmp/tmp.2NM50m2I8p/revision.tex:821:We note that \Cref{lem:pseudorandom-alon-yuster-type} is a simplified version of Theorem 7.1 in~\cite{kang2020new}, but this simpler version is sufficient for our purpose.
