classes of marked pseudoline arrangements and that changing one sign is exactly
a triangle flip.  Lemma 12 constructs monotone paths to shellable arrangements,
with no triple flipped twice.  The conclusion explicitly leaves the complexity
of computing a shortest path in the flip graph open.

