Implemented and locally verified the Track B generator based on Proposition 1.7’s parity obstruction in the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.15909).

- [gen_2310_15909.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2310.15909/gen_2310_15909.py)
