- [README.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2310.15909/README.md)

All local G1–G9 gates pass. The adversary panel now includes six attacks, including bounded DPLL with unit/cardinality propagation; all score 0/8. The efficient Track B reference algorithm succeeds 8/8.

The result cannot yet be declared shipped: the required bare, hinted, and placebo oracle runs all returned OpenRouter HTTP 403 `Key limit exceeded`. Their script-owned error transcripts remain for audit. No `REJECTED.md` was created because this is an external quota blocker, not a family failure.
